  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.21469116210938,
        527.4259033203125,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "Clinical monitoring:  The risk of emergence of bedaquiline resistance should be a key consideration",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.385986328125,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "when the drug is being used. Due to the difficulties in obtaining a suitable specimen from children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.5839233398438,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "aged below 6 years, performing DST may be challenging. However, if there are concerns about",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.395751953125,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "acquired drug resistance, every effort should be made to obtain a suitable sample, such as gastric",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        466.51202392578125,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "aspirate, sputum induction or NPA (stool is not a suitable sample for conducting DST).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.454345703125,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "In the IMPAACT P1108 study, none of the children aged below 6 years had QT prolongation in any",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.44091796875,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "of the categories of 60 milliseconds and above. Almost all children also received clofazimine. Three",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.4242553710938,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "children (of 11; 27%) experienced QT prolongation of 30–60 milliseconds, which was described as mild",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966599464416504,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        527.4354248046875,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "and insignificant. In general, the use of bedaquiline in populations with underlying cardiac conduction",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979781150817871,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69471740722656,
        527.3937377929688,
        209.13771057128906
      ],
      "text": "abnormalities and concomitant medications that prolong QTc needs to be carefully considered. A",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.4432983398438,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "major implementation consideration includes the need for safety monitoring, as well as the need to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.4367065429688,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "build staff capacity (training, capacity building) to ensure that appropriate safety monitoring is put in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.1395263671875,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "place. Additional costs associated with wider implementation of bedaquiline (in addition to the higher",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981735229492188,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.3936767578125,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "cost of the drug), include availability of ECG machines, appropriate monitoring and trained staff to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.6947021484375,
        527.42236328125,
        275.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "perform these activities. However, the GDG felt that savings related to potential shorter treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        527.3968505859375,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "duration as well as the avoidance of additional resource requirements related to injectable use (such",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        527.3870849609375,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "as for monitoring with audiometry and implications for child development), outweigh the costs of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.294677734375,
        283.93280029296875,
        314.7377014160156
      ],
      "text": "bedaquiline introduction and implementation.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.576416015625,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "Adaptation of the recommendation to the local context will require staff capacity building and training,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.964943885803223,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.4168090820312,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "followed by supportive supervision and mentoring. Implementing all-oral treatment regimens will",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39862060546875,
        524.3898315429688,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "facilitate decentralization of MDR-TB treatment services and may therefore improve access to patient-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.973769187927246,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        130.31878662109375,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "centred care.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        386.5812072753906,
        223.77130126953125,
        402.4331970214844
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.64111328125,
        527.5665283203125,
        424.0841369628906
      ],
      "text": "People with TB, including children who receive a shorter or longer MDR-TB treatment regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.8412170410156,
        527.4091796875,
        437.28424072265625
      ],
      "text": "need to be monitored for response to treatment and for safety during treatment using schedules",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        436.0411071777344,
        527.4069213867188,
        450.484130859375
      ],
      "text": "of relevant clinical and laboratory testing. This has been successfully applied in previous studies of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        449.2411193847656,
        474.9324035644531,
        463.68414306640625
      ],
      "text": "shorter regimens under field conditions and in the programmatic setting in South Africa.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        468.151123046875,
        527.4412841796875,
        485.38812255859375
      ],
      "text": "(89) The WHO framework for active drug safety monitoring   needs to be applied to people with TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.1451110839844,
        527.2071533203125,
        498.588134765625
      ],
      "text": "on any type of MDR-TB regimen, to ensure appropriate action and an acceptable level of monitoring",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99479866027832,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        497.3450927734375,
        527.380615234375,
        511.7881164550781
      ],
      "text": "for and prompt response to adverse events – alongside monitoring for treatment outcomes.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        510.54510498046875,
        527.4551391601562,
        524.9880981445312
      ],
      "text": "Electrocardiography is indicated for children on regimens with two or three agents that are expected",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        523.7451171875,
        527.578369140625,
        538.1881103515625
      ],
      "text": "to prolong the QT interval. Specific biochemical tests should also be made available according to the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996899604797363,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        536.945068359375,
        219.95529174804688,
        551.3880615234375
      ],
      "text": "agents included in the regimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        558.6490478515625,
        527.4056396484375,
        573.092041015625
      ],
      "text": "In children, smear and culture monitoring of the response to treatment may be challenging, due to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        571.8489990234375,
        527.5519409179688,
        586.2919921875
      ],
      "text": "difficulties in obtaining appropriate specimens for testing. However, in children with a bacteriologically",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976425170898438,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        585.0490112304688,
        527.4246215820312,
        599.4920043945312
      ],
      "text": "confirmed diagnosis, all reasonable efforts should be taken to demonstrate bacteriological conversion.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.959675788879395,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        598.2490234375,
        527.43212890625,
        612.6920166015625
      ],
      "text": "Once cultures have become negative or in children who never had a confirmed diagnosis, repeated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        611.448974609375,
        527.427978515625,
        625.8919677734375
      ],
      "text": "respiratory sampling may not be useful if the child is otherwise responding well clinically. Resolution",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        624.6489868164062,
        527.4267578125,
        639.0919799804688
      ],
      "text": "of clinical symptoms and weight gain can be used as indicators of improvement. All children should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        637.8489990234375,
        527.4365234375,
        652.2919921875
      ],
      "text": "have regular clinical follow-up, including weight and height monitoring. Drug dosages should be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        651.0490112304688,
        243.54037475585938,
        665.4920043945312
      ],
      "text": "adjusted with weight gain, as needed.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        672.7529296875,
        527.599365234375,
        687.1959228515625
      ],
      "text": "Recording and reporting of details on the diagnosis, treatment regimens, clinical monitoring and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        685.952880859375,
        527.265869140625,
        700.3958740234375
      ],
      "text": "treatment outcomes of children and adolescents with MDR/RR-TB is important to monitor the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        699.1528930664062,
        527.4365234375,
        713.5958862304688
      ],
      "text": "programmatic implementation of newly recommended regimens as well as efforts to improve case",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        712.35302734375,
        527.5714111328125,
        726.7960205078125
      ],
      "text": "finding of children with DR-TB. Data from national programmes on the use of bedaquiline in children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997650146484375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        725.552978515625,
        319.48260498046875,
        739.9959716796875
      ],
      "text": "of all ages is important to increase the evidence base.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        344.452392578125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "5. Treatment of TB disease in children and adolescents 47",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}